/datum/blooper
	/// shown in the prefs
	var/name
	/// the clean take
	var/sound
	/// through a gas mask and co
	var/muffled_sound
	/// band-limited and crunchy
	var/radio_sound
	/// gas mask over the radio, the worst of both
	var/radio_muffled_sound

